---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import ModuleSpotlightGrid from '../components/home/ModuleSpotlightGrid';
---
<AppLayout title="Home">
  <section class="page-width hero-stage">
    <div class="hero-stage__grid">
      <div class="hero-stage__copy">
        <span class="hero-kicker">Finite mathematics · built for studying</span>
        <h1 class="hero-title">See the <span class="gradient-text">rule</span>, then work it yourself.</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">A local-first AMAT 19 course companion for logic, probability, finance, matrices, and applications. Every result comes from deterministic math; the interface exposes the structure, legal steps, and repair path behind it.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="hero-action hero-action--primary" href="/study">Start today’s study →</a><a class="hero-action hero-action--secondary" href="/course">Browse the course</a></div>
        <div class="hero-stage__meta"><span class="status-pill">No account</span><span class="status-pill">Works offline after caching</span><span class="status-pill">Original practice</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-width section-shell" aria-labelledby="modules-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Course map</p><h2 id="modules-heading">Five modules, one connected skill graph.</h2></div><a href="/course">Open roadmap →</a></div><ModuleSpotlightGrid client:visible /></section>
  <section class="page-width section-shell" aria-labelledby="loop-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Learning loop</p><h2 id="loop-heading">Learn → manipulate → practice → repair → retrieve.</h2></div></div><div class="route-grid"><a class="route-link" href="/study"><span><strong>Study Queue</strong><small>Continue unfinished work, repair recent misses, and surface the next useful skill.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="route-link" href="/practice"><span><strong>Adaptive Practice</strong><small>Quick 5, weak areas, module drills, and whole-course retrieval generated from the skill graph.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="route-link" href="/progress"><span><strong>Skill Evidence</strong><small>Track New, Learning, Developing, and Secure evidence without pretending it is a course grade.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="page-width feature-band" aria-labelledby="principles-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Product principles</p><h2 id="principles-heading">An interactive mathematics tool, not a calculator skin.</h2></div><div class="feature-band__grid"><p><strong>Deterministic first.</strong> Truth tables, exact fractions, row operations, and optimization decisions are produced by explicit domain engines.</p><p><strong>Local first.</strong> Progress, drafts, saved items, and study sessions stay in this browser unless you export them.</p><p><strong>Course aware.</strong> Current requirements and older supplemental depth stay visibly separated.</p></div></section>
</AppLayout>
